      368.17,
      537.92,
      451.24
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 3 of the Excise (Special Provisions) Act, No. 13 of 1989, as amended,I, Mahinda Rajapaksa, Minister of Finance and Economic Affairs, do by this Order declare that, the rate of Excise dutyapplicable on every article specified in the Columns I, II and III of the Schedule hereto, shall replace corresponding everyarticle specified under the Schedule I of the Extraordinary Gazette Notification No. 2044/32 dated November 09, 2017and Schedule of the Extraordinary Gazette Notification No. 2097/3 dated November 12,2018, issued under Section 3of this Act, shall be as specified in the corresponding entry in Column IV of the Schedule, with effect from December04, 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
