      464.17,
      537.88,
      487.24
    ],
    "text": "The order made under Section 3 of the Excise (Special Provisions) Act, No. 13 of 1989 and published in the ExtraordinaryGazette Notification No. 2097/3 dated November 12, 2018 is hereby rescinded with effect from December 04, 2018.",
